@page "/"

<h1>SQL Server Query Tool</h1>

<p>Welcome to the SQL Server Query Tool. This application allows you to:</p>

<ul>
    <li>Connect to a SQL Server database using a connection string</li>
    <li>Execute SQL queries against the database</li>
    <li>View query results and statistics</li>
    <li>Export query results to Excel</li>
</ul>

<div class="mt-4">
    <a href="/sqlquery" class="btn btn-primary">Go to SQL Query Tool</a>
</div>
